{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"latex","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"LaTeX","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for LaTeX (.tex .sty .cls .bib).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"latex","name":"LaTeX","extensions":[".tex",".sty",".cls",".bib"],"grammar":"grammars/latex.json","lineComment":"%"}],"snippets":[{"language":"LaTeX","path":"snippets/latex.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/latex.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"%.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\\\\\(?:begin|end)\\\\{[A-Za-z*]+\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\\\\\[A-Za-z]+\\\\*?\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$\\\\$[^$]*\\\\$\\\\$|\\\\$[^$]+\\\\$\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\\\\\[\\\\\\\\{}%&$#_]\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[{}\\\\[\\\\]]\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/latex.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Document\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"doc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"\\\\\\\\documentclass{${1:article}}\",\n      \"\\\\\\\\usepackage[utf8]{inputenc}\",\n      \"\",\n      \"\\\\\\\\begin{document}\",\n      \"$0\",\n      \"\\\\\\\\end{document}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A document skeleton\"\n  },\n  \"Section\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sec\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"\\\\\\\\section{${1:Title}}\",\n      \"$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A section\"\n  },\n  \"Environment\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"env\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"\\\\\\\\begin{${1:itemize}}\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"\\\\\\\\end{${1:itemize}}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An environment\"\n  },\n  \"Figure\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fig\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"\\\\\\\\begin{figure}[h]\",\n      \"\\t\\\\\\\\centering\",\n      \"\\t\\\\\\\\includegraphics[width=0.8\\\\\\\\textwidth]{${1:file}}\",\n      \"\\t\\\\\\\\caption{${2:Caption}}\",\n      \"\\\\\\\\end{figure}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A figure\"\n  },\n  \"Equation\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"eq\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"\\\\\\\\begin{equation}\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"\\\\\\\\end{equation}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An equation\"\n  },\n  \"Itemize\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"item\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"\\\\\\\\begin{itemize}\",\n      \"\\t\\\\\\\\item $0\",\n      \"\\\\\\\\end{itemize}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A bullet list\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# LaTeX\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for LaTeX.\n\n## Files\n\n`.tex`, `.sty`, `.cls`, `.bib`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `%`.\n- 6 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `doc` | A document skeleton |\n| `sec` | A section |\n| `env` | An environment |\n| `fig` | A figure |\n| `eq` | An equation |\n| `item` | A bullet list |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}